WGP-ABF uses a file-scoped dual-license model.

1. Whitepaper text, README files, governance prose, and original visual assets
   are licensed under Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International
   (CC BY 4.0). The full text is in LICENSES/CC-BY-4.0.txt.

2. JSON Schemas, examples, scripts, validators, and reference software are
   licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. The full text is in
   LICENSES/Apache-2.0.txt.

3. Third-party material remains under its stated license and must be recorded
   in an adjacent provenance or notice file.

4. Project names, logos, certification marks, and endorsement rights are not
   granted by either license. See TRADEMARKS.md.

SPDX identifiers in individual files take precedence when present.
